The pattern followed here is:

According to the positional values of the alphabets,

 [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2e1a2f0dc142ecfb544963c2209981c3e759d0cf81e91577dd86d50c0a2dc835.png] 

A + 5 = F; F + 5 = **K**; K + 5 = P; P + 5 = U;

B + 5 = G; G + 5 = **L**; L + 5 = Q; Q + 5 = V;

D + 5 = I; I + 5 = **N**; N + 5 = S; S + 5 = X;

E + 5 = J; J + 5 = **O**; O + 5 = T; T + 5 = Y

Hence, ‘KLNO’ is the correct answer

The pattern followed here is:

 [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2e1a2f0dc142ecfb544963c2209981c3e759d0cf81e91577dd86d50c0a2dc835.png] 

W - 6 → Q;

Q - 5 → **L**;

L - 4 → H;

H - 3 → E;

E - 2 → C

Hence, ‘L’ is the correct answer.
